<header><p class="enc-kicker">Event</p><h1 class="enc-title">Great Reduction</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1680s</span> · <a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Great Reduction was the recovery by the Swedish crown of lands previously granted or sold to the nobility, carried out under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-xi-of-sweden">Charles XI</a> in the 1680s. It restored royal finances, strengthened the absolutist monarchy and funded the military system of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/swedish-empire">Swedish Empire</a>.</p></div>
